※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4618 LANG_MADE_IN_NOT_AN_ARENA

※ What follows `in` in a signature is a parameter holding an arena, `&mut arena` or `&arena`.
※ A local arena is given back before the call ends and cannot be named, and `⎕heap` is what
※ saying nothing already allows.

fn named(v: u16) → str in v:
    "x"

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    if named(1u16) = "x": 0u6 else: 1u6
